# Rev.com

> Rev provides industry-leading speech-to-text services, including AI and human transcription, captions, multilingual subtitles, and deposition summaries. Our technology combines the power of humans and artificial intelligence to support industries such as legal, media, education, technology, and enterprise communications.

## Key Offerings

- AI-created and human transcription services  
- AI-created and human captions for live and recorded content  
- Subtitles and translations in global languages  
- AI-generated deposition summaries in partnership with Smartdepo  
- AI assistant and customizable AI template capabilities for deeper analysis on all uploaded files

